@description FFmpeg 8 series for Windows
@version 8.1
@author FFmpeg team
@about
  # FFmpeg v8.1
  Only REAPER v7.66 above. Only necessary files. Only Windows.
@changelog
  - The last version of FFmpeg that REAPER supports. Only REAPER v7.66 above.
@provides
