   [windows] avformat-62.dll https://github.com/wastee/ReaScripts/releases/download/v$version/avformat-62.dll
   [windows] avutil-60.dll https://github.com/wastee/ReaScripts/releases/download/v$version/avutil-60.dll
   [windows] ffmpeg.exe https://github.com/wastee/ReaScripts/releases/download/v$version/ffmpeg.exe
   [windows] ffplay.exe https://github.com/wastee/ReaScripts/releases/download/v$version/ffplay.exe
   [windows] ffprobe.exe https://github.com/wastee/ReaScripts/releases/download/v$version/ffprobe.exe
